From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin <devin@cognition.ai>
Date: Sun, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: drop the permanently-red Node 16 build leg

vite@5 requires Node ^18 || >=20 — the matrix leg on Node 16 fails at
resolveConfig every run (verified: `vite build` exits 1 under node@16,
0 under node@18 and node@20). Trim the matrix to [18, 20].

---
diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
index 7e514a4..c2757df 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
@@ -179,7 +179,7 @@ jobs:
 
     strategy:
       matrix:
-        node-version: [16, 18, 20]
+        node-version: [18, 20]
 
     steps:
       - name: Checkout code
